@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_YOUR_AUTH_SERVICE

### All dashboard results for one quarter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard?quarterFrom=202603&quarterTo=202603
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No-data quarter (choose a valid key absent from your database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard?quarterFrom=209903&quarterTo=209903
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Specific RM + quarter + status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard?quarterFrom=202603&quarterTo=202606&rmCode=RM001&status=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Available quarters in current role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard/quarters/available
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Separate REST endpoint for quarter chart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard/quarters?quarterFrom=202603&quarterTo=202606
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Separate REST endpoint for RM chart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard/rms?quarterFrom=202603&quarterTo=202606
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid quarter -> HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard?quarterFrom=202613
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No authentication -> HTTP 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/equity-dashboard
